---@field relativeLink? gcp.slides_v1.LinkRelativeLinkEnum|string If set, indicates this is a link to a slide in this presentation, addressed by its position.
---@field pageObjectId? string If set, indicates this is a link to the specific page in this presentation with this ID. A page with this ID may not exist.
---@field url? string If set, indicates this is a link to the external web page at this URL.

---@alias gcp.slides_v1.LinkRelativeLinkEnum "RELATIVE_SLIDE_LINK_UNSPECIFIED"|"NEXT_SLIDE"|"PREVIOUS_SLIDE"|"FIRST_SLIDE"|"LAST_SLIDE"

