---@field mergeTableCells? gcp.slides_v1.MergeTableCellsRequest Merges cells in a Table.
---@field duplicateObject? gcp.slides_v1.DuplicateObjectRequest Duplicates a slide or page element.
---@field deleteTableColumn? gcp.slides_v1.DeleteTableColumnRequest Deletes a column from a table.
