---@field createLine? gcp.slides_v1.CreateLineRequest Creates a line.
---@field groupObjects? gcp.slides_v1.GroupObjectsRequest Groups objects, such as page elements.
---@field updateShapeProperties? gcp.slides_v1.UpdateShapePropertiesRequest Updates the properties of a Shape.
---@field deleteTableRow? gcp.slides_v1.DeleteTableRowRequest Deletes a row from a table.
---@field updateImageProperties? gcp.slides_v1.UpdateImagePropertiesRequest Updates the properties of an Image.
---@field updatePageElementAltText? gcp.slides_v1.UpdatePageElementAltTextRequest Updates the alt text title and/or description of a page element.
---@field createParagraphBullets? gcp.slides_v1.CreateParagraphBulletsRequest Creates bullets for paragraphs.
---@field rerouteLine? gcp.slides_v1.RerouteLineRequest Reroutes a line such that it's connected at the two closest connection sites on the connected page elements.
