---@field updatePageProperties? gcp.slides_v1.UpdatePagePropertiesRequest Updates the properties of a Page.
---@field insertTableRows? gcp.slides_v1.InsertTableRowsRequest Inserts rows into a table.
---@field updatePageElementTransform? gcp.slides_v1.UpdatePageElementTransformRequest Updates the transform of a page element.
---@field createSheetsChart? gcp.slides_v1.CreateSheetsChartRequest Creates an embedded Google Sheets chart.
---@field createImage? gcp.slides_v1.CreateImageRequest Creates an image.
---@field updateLineProperties? gcp.slides_v1.UpdateLinePropertiesRequest Updates the properties of a Line.
---@field unmergeTableCells? gcp.slides_v1.UnmergeTableCellsRequest Unmerges cells in a Table.
---@field createVideo? gcp.slides_v1.CreateVideoRequest Creates a video.
---@field updateLineCategory? gcp.slides_v1.UpdateLineCategoryRequest Updates the category of a line.
---@field deleteCommentReply? gcp.slides_v1.DeleteCommentReplyRequest Deletes a reply Post from a CommentThread.
---@field ungroupObjects? gcp.slides_v1.UngroupObjectsRequest Ungroups objects, such as groups.
---@field createShape? gcp.slides_v1.CreateShapeRequest Creates a new shape.
---@field updatePageElementsZOrder? gcp.slides_v1.UpdatePageElementsZOrderRequest Updates the Z-order of page elements.
---@field updateSlideProperties? gcp.slides_v1.UpdateSlidePropertiesRequest Updates the properties of a Slide
---@field updateCommentPost? gcp.slides_v1.UpdateCommentPostRequest Updates an existing post (head post or reply) of a CommentThread.
---@field replaceImage? gcp.slides_v1.ReplaceImageRequest Replaces an existing image with a new image.
---@field updateParagraphStyle? gcp.slides_v1.UpdateParagraphStyleRequest Updates the styling of paragraphs within a Shape or Table.
---@field addCommentReply? gcp.slides_v1.AddCommentReplyRequest Adds a reply to a CommentThread.
---@field replaceAllShapesWithImage? gcp.slides_v1.ReplaceAllShapesWithImageRequest Replaces all shapes matching some criteria with an image.
---@field deleteObject? gcp.slides_v1.DeleteObjectRequest Deletes a page or page element from the presentation.
---@field createSlide? gcp.slides_v1.CreateSlideRequest Creates a new slide.
---@field deleteComment? gcp.slides_v1.DeleteCommentRequest Deletes a CommentThread.
---@field updateVideoProperties? gcp.slides_v1.UpdateVideoPropertiesRequest Updates the properties of a Video.
---@field deleteParagraphBullets? gcp.slides_v1.DeleteParagraphBulletsRequest Deletes bullets from paragraphs.
