---@field updateTableBorderProperties? gcp.slides_v1.UpdateTableBorderPropertiesRequest Updates the properties of the table borders in a Table.
---@field replaceAllShapesWithSheetsChart? gcp.slides_v1.ReplaceAllShapesWithSheetsChartRequest Replaces all shapes matching some criteria with a Google Sheets chart.
---@field createTable? gcp.slides_v1.CreateTableRequest Creates a new table.
