---@field deleteText? gcp.slides_v1.DeleteTextRequest Deletes text from a shape or a table cell.
---@field updateSlidesPosition? gcp.slides_v1.UpdateSlidesPositionRequest Updates the position of a set of slides in the presentation.
---@field updateTableCellProperties? gcp.slides_v1.UpdateTableCellPropertiesRequest Updates the properties of a TableCell.
---@field updateTableColumnProperties? gcp.slides_v1.UpdateTableColumnPropertiesRequest Updates the properties of a Table column.

---@alias gcp.slides_v1.RequestList gcp.slides_v1.Request[]

---Reroutes a line such that it's connected at the two closest connection sites on the connected page elements.
