---@field createLine? gcp.slides_v1.CreateLineResponse The result of creating a line.
---@field createImage? gcp.slides_v1.CreateImageResponse The result of creating an image.
---@field createShape? gcp.slides_v1.CreateShapeResponse The result of creating a shape.
---@field replaceAllShapesWithSheetsChart? gcp.slides_v1.ReplaceAllShapesWithSheetsChartResponse The result of replacing all shapes matching some criteria with a Google Sheets chart.
