---@class gcp.slides_v1.TableRow
---@field tableCells? gcp.slides_v1.TableCellList Properties and contents of each cell. Cells that span multiple columns are represented only once with a column_span greater than 1. As a result, the length of this collection does not always match the number of columns of the entire table.
---@field rowHeight? gcp.slides_v1.Dimension Height of a row.
---@field tableRowProperties? gcp.slides_v1.TableRowProperties Properties of the row.

